      "label": "coach_gym_koori_randomtalk_03",
      "hash64": "EBF1DC29191CA4BC",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)][VAR 0x0101(0001)]’s doing pretty good. Gets\\nalong\\r\\nfine\\r\\nwith\\r\\nmy\\r\\nother\\r\\nPokémon.\\c\\nIt’s real chill. I like it.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
